msgbox	DAD: Hm?Well, if it isn't PLAYER! So you're all finished moving in?I'm surprised that you managed to get here by yourself.Oh, I see. You're with your POKéMON.Hm… Then I guess you're going to become a TRAINER like me, PLAYER.That's great news! I'll be looking forward to it!
closemessage
switch VAR_FACING
