msgbox	DAD: With that BADGE, the DEFENSE of all your POKéMON will increase.POKéMON that know the HM move SURF will be able to travel over water.This is my gift to you. PLAYER, I'm sure you can use it correctly.
setflag FLAG_DEFEATED_PETALBURG_GYM
